   "moves": "FVM and FDM of the boards with a drawn layer that has a cell cut by a zone edge, at 2 mm (their other copper edges lie on cell lines), and their times to 63 %; the three new harness boards drawn_*. Outside the frozen boards (reproduction pass, prose, no stored tolerance): the calculator's JEDEC board without vias +12.0 % (74.6 to 83.5 K/W at 0.5 mm, the converged value; the earlier value was a grid error of the cut land), the other calculator rows +0.9 to +1.1 %; band for the reproduction pass: FVM where a drawn edge cuts a cell up to +12.5 % of a part's rise (releases/2.8.0/reproduction/LUMPED_SHIFTS_REVIEW.md 2)"
  },
  {
   "id": "M3",
