   "evidence": "docs/validation.md 48 and 53; research/lumped-edge-link README 3.6",
   "moves": "Lumped of every board (51 records at 2, 1 and 0.5 mm, 12 times to 63 %): part rows up (up to 14.9 K on the part peak of a lone part), the board maximum -0.5 to +3.1 % of the rise. Outside the frozen boards (reproduction pass, prose, no stored tolerance): an isolated part whose copper is only its footprint +7.1 % of the rise on the board maximum, pads of 20 to 80 mm +1.6 to +3.3 % (copper_dissipation, 1 mm); band for the reproduction pass: Lumped board maximum -0.5 to +7.5 % of the rise (releases/2.8.0/reproduction/LUMPED_SHIFTS_REVIEW.md 1)"
  },
